  fishName: Greatwale
  description: These enormous mammals originate from another world entirely, where
    they have long been extinct. They were brought to Boreala in a desperate attempt
    to keep their species alive, and have fared surprisingly well here for over 200
    years.\n\n  Chef's notes:\nI prefer "quality" over "quantity", but the Wale is
    happy marriage of both. It's enormous size and ample fat reserves combine to
    be a truly delectable mountain of caloric quality.
